1
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,840
♪Amid the sea of faces♪

2
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:13,720
♪Our eyes meet by chance♪

3
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,080
♪Through the restless years♪

4
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:20,560
♪Time suddenly slows♪

5
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:24,000
♪No vows need be made♪

6
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,360
♪Though seas and mountains lie ahead♪

7
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,440
♪One glance says it all♪

8
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:32,880
♪Beyond a thousand words♪

9
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:37,280
♪With you by my side♪

10
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:40,400
♪I dare brave a thousand trials♪

11
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:43,680
♪Though mist may veil the road ahead♪

12
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:47,080
♪Hand in hand, no counting years♪

13
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:50,320
♪With you by my side♪

14
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:53,880
♪No need to speak my heart at length♪

15
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:57,200
♪As rivers and mountains change♪

16
00:00:57,720 --> 00:00:59,360
♪May we remain together♪

17
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:03,520
♪From dawn to dusk♪

18
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:07,000
=Daughter of a Concubine=

19
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:09,920
=Episode 6=

20
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,359
I have other matters to attend to.

21
00:01:36,599 --> 00:01:38,719
I won't see you home.

22
00:01:39,519 --> 00:01:41,680
Thank you for saving my life,
Young General.

23
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:42,480
No need.

24
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:45,719
I just didn't want to
see an innocent person

25
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:47,000
die in the Xia Residence.

26
00:01:48,959 --> 00:01:50,280
Don't worry, Young General.

27
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:52,239
I'll keep myself alive.

28
00:01:53,079 --> 00:01:53,959
That's good.

29
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,719
Without this veil,

30
00:01:59,439 --> 00:02:00,359
things look clearer.

31
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:11,719
Thank you.

32
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,120
General.

33
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:24,479
Young Madam does seem pitiful.

34
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:26,240
Someone like her

35
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:28,080
doesn't survive on pity.

36
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:33,919
You were pretty fierce today, though.

37
00:02:33,919 --> 00:02:34,719
Of course.

38
00:02:34,719 --> 00:02:36,120
Just look whose soldier I am.

39
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:39,560
There's something I don't understand.

40
00:02:40,199 --> 00:02:42,840
You said Young Madam was cunning.

41
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:45,080
Yet today, to help her,

42
00:02:45,199 --> 00:02:47,800
you dropped the lead
on Old Master's case and rushed back.

43
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:50,159
That's not like you.

44
00:02:50,159 --> 00:02:51,360
Why make an exception today?

45
00:02:51,479 --> 00:02:52,759
She's blind,

46
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:55,280
and has endured years of abuse
in the Xia family.

47
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:57,560
If I hadn't stepped in today,

48
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:59,639
she'd never have made it out alive.

49
00:03:00,039 --> 00:03:01,000
I'd have done the same

50
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:01,800
for anyone else.

51
00:03:03,159 --> 00:03:03,919
Let's go.

52
00:03:03,919 --> 00:03:05,280
We're finding Physician Li.

53
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,240
Okay.

54
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,280
(Three days...)

55
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,599
(I'll be back in three days.)

56
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:17,159
(If you're dead by then,)

57
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,599
(I'll have misjudged you.)

58
00:03:19,269 --> 00:03:23,699
- Hyah!
- Hyah!

59
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:49,960
(Serene Quarter of Orchid Grace)

60
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,439
Miss Yun...

61
00:03:58,120 --> 00:04:00,520
I've only brought you trouble.

62
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:03,879
Nannie, please don't say that.

63
00:04:03,879 --> 00:04:05,680
You suffered because of me.

64
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:09,919
I failed your mother.

65
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:15,479
Before she passed away,
she asked me to look after you.

66
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:17,480
But I...

67
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:21,839
When my mother died,
her nails were black.

68
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:24,000
Her lips were purple.

69
00:04:25,519 --> 00:04:27,279
Someone poisoned her.

70
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,639
Miss Yun...

71
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:31,480
Do you believe Lady Wang's story?

72
00:04:33,399 --> 00:04:34,879
Did you kill my mother?

73
00:04:35,279 --> 00:04:36,680
If I'd wanted her dead,

74
00:04:37,399 --> 00:04:39,120
she wouldn't have lasted a year.

75
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:42,839
I wanted to watch her suffer.

76
00:04:43,319 --> 00:04:45,040
Besides,

77
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,959
if she were dead,

78
00:04:46,959 --> 00:04:48,800
how could I torment you?

79
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,759
She doesn't seem to be lying.

80
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:55,000
Whoever killed my mother

81
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,959
covered their tracks too well.

82
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,600
That didn't look like Lady Wang.

83
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:01,639
Nannie.

84
00:05:01,639 --> 00:05:03,480
You served my mother the longest.

85
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,079
As far as you recall,

86
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:08,000
did my mother ever offend anyone?

87
00:05:08,519 --> 00:05:09,759
Or...

88
00:05:09,759 --> 00:05:11,600
Was there anyone close to her?

89
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:15,759
Your mother was always very cautious.

90
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:18,879
I never saw her make an enemy.

91
00:05:21,399 --> 00:05:24,000
As for those she was close to,

92
00:05:24,279 --> 00:05:25,839
there was one person.

93
00:05:26,079 --> 00:05:29,360
Third Madam of the Cheng family.

94
00:05:31,439 --> 00:05:33,120
Third Madam of the Cheng family?

95
00:05:33,399 --> 00:05:34,319
Yes.

96
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:37,720
The wife of Third Master Cheng.

97
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:43,639
Back then, she and your mother
were like sisters.

98
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:46,000
They shared everything.

99
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,040
Later,

100
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:53,720
they were saying Third Madam
poisoned Old Master.

101
00:05:55,439 --> 00:05:57,680
After he died,

102
00:05:57,920 --> 00:06:00,600
Third Madam also died suddenly.

103
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,759
Before she died,

104
00:06:03,959 --> 00:06:07,319
she entrusted her only daughter
to your mother.

105
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:10,279
But your mother could

106
00:06:10,279 --> 00:06:12,319
barely protect herself then.

107
00:06:12,639 --> 00:06:15,000
She couldn't look after the girl.

108
00:06:16,519 --> 00:06:17,480
Third Madam...

109
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:18,759
(Who do you think you are?)

110
00:06:18,759 --> 00:06:21,360
(A concubine's daughter,
strutting around this house?)

111
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:23,040
(Who do you think you are?)

112
00:06:23,319 --> 00:06:24,199
(Your mother's a murderer.)

113
00:06:24,199 --> 00:06:25,360
(That makes you a little murderer.)

114
00:06:25,839 --> 00:06:26,879
(Get out of my way!)

115
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:32,720
That girl is the daughter
of Third Madam,

116
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:33,879
the third Miss?

117
00:06:33,879 --> 00:06:34,680
Yes.

118
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:36,720
Her name is Cheng Xiaoxuan.

119
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:39,360
Before your mother passed away,

120
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:41,839
she never stopped thinking of that girl.

121
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:45,319
Cheng Xiaoxuan...

122
00:06:46,079 --> 00:06:49,439
(My mother's death
was no simple matter.)

123
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:51,560
That new Young Madam...

124
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:53,399
I hear she burned off
Zhou Lanxin's hair.

125
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:56,639
- Young...
- Young...

126
00:06:56,879 --> 00:06:57,920
- Young Madam.
- Young Madam.

127
00:06:58,079 --> 00:07:00,199
Next time you gossip about me,
do it somewhere farther off.

128
00:07:00,439 --> 00:07:01,600
I have sharp ears.

129
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,399
- Yes.
- Yes.

130
00:07:02,399 --> 00:07:04,000
- We won't do it again.
- We won't do it again.

131
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,920
Where is the third Miss's courtyard?

132
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:07,959
I want to see it.

133
00:07:07,959 --> 00:07:10,120
The third Miss's mother was a murderer.

134
00:07:10,199 --> 00:07:11,160
She's bad luck.

135
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:14,079
No one in the house dares go there.

136
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,199
Young Madam.

137
00:07:15,199 --> 00:07:16,759
Her courtyard is remote.

138
00:07:16,839 --> 00:07:18,000
You'd best not go.

139
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,120
I don't fear bad luck.

140
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:19,879
Take me there.

141
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:22,079
Yes.

142
00:07:22,079 --> 00:07:22,759
Yes.

143
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:27,000
Is she really blind?

144
00:07:31,279 --> 00:07:32,240
Young Madam.

145
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,920
That's the courtyard up ahead.

146
00:07:34,639 --> 00:07:35,480
You two may leave.

147
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:36,160
- Yes.
- Yes.

148
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,160
- Young Madam.
- Young Madam.

149
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,639
Come out.

150
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:09,160
One of Zhou Lanxin's people?

151
00:08:11,279 --> 00:08:12,240
Young Madam.

152
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:14,160
My mistress sends word.

153
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,199
Speak.

154
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,879
The third Miss's life is worthless.

155
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:20,639
But yours is not.

156
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:25,720
Kill the third Miss with this knife.

157
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:27,800
Keep this to yourself,

158
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,120
and no one will know.

159
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,680
If I kill her,

160
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:33,720
with blood on my hands, I'd die too.

161
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,120
Two birds with one stone.

162
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:37,360
A clever scheme.

163
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:40,399
You're sharp, Young Madam.

164
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:42,399
But if you don't kill her,

165
00:08:42,559 --> 00:08:45,440
you won't leave this courtyard alive!

166
00:08:47,519 --> 00:08:49,799
You knew I'd be here today.

167
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:52,399
But you overlooked one thing.

168
00:09:05,519 --> 00:09:06,320
Don't move.

169
00:09:07,279 --> 00:09:08,960
Go back and tell your mistress.

170
00:09:09,279 --> 00:09:11,360
The third Miss is under my protection.

171
00:09:11,799 --> 00:09:13,240
Anyone who touches her

172
00:09:13,399 --> 00:09:14,440
answers to me first.

173
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:15,919
Get lost!

174
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:43,759
(Mother.)

175
00:09:45,039 --> 00:09:47,000
(Whenever I'm bullied,)

176
00:09:48,399 --> 00:09:50,639
(I'd smell the sachet you made for me.)

177
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:54,399
(It's like hearing your comfort.)

178
00:09:56,039 --> 00:09:56,840
(Mother...)

179
00:09:57,639 --> 00:09:59,279
(I miss you so much.)

180
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:06,240
Who's there?

181
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,000
Little sister.

182
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,120
Who are you?

183
00:10:16,559 --> 00:10:17,919
I just married in.

184
00:10:17,919 --> 00:10:19,440
I'm Cheng Mingzhi's wife.

185
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,480
Sister.

186
00:10:21,639 --> 00:10:22,559
What brings you here?

187
00:10:22,879 --> 00:10:24,200
Just came to see you.

188
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:25,679
I heard you live here alone.

189
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:28,960
That's kind of you, Sister.

190
00:10:29,159 --> 00:10:29,879
Please, sit.

191
00:10:43,799 --> 00:10:45,200
My courtyard is rather remote.

192
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:47,840
Hardly anyone comes by.

193
00:10:48,039 --> 00:10:49,000
Have some water.

194
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:51,440
Living here alone, little sister,

195
00:10:51,519 --> 00:10:52,639
aren't you afraid?

196
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:54,720
What good would fear do?

197
00:10:54,799 --> 00:10:55,960
In this Cheng Residence,

198
00:10:56,679 --> 00:10:59,039
no one cares about
a murderer's daughter.

199
00:11:01,679 --> 00:11:05,000
I know what it's like to grow up
without a mother.

200
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:07,480
My mother is dead, too.

201
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:11,279
She knew your mother.

202
00:11:12,639 --> 00:11:13,600
She did?

203
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:15,679
Who was your mother?

204
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,000
Liu Rumei.

205
00:11:18,279 --> 00:11:19,279
Aunt Liu?

206
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:22,840
She and my mother
were the best of sisters.

207
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,200
My mother told me

208
00:11:24,519 --> 00:11:27,080
she was the only person she could trust.

209
00:11:27,600 --> 00:11:28,879
You're her daughter?

210
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:32,759
On my way here,

211
00:11:32,759 --> 00:11:33,799
someone stopped me.

212
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:34,960
Stopped you?

213
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:35,759
Who?

214
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:38,320
Most likely Zhou Lanxin's people.

215
00:11:40,159 --> 00:11:41,039
Don't be afraid.

216
00:11:41,759 --> 00:11:43,120
She gave me a knife

217
00:11:43,159 --> 00:11:44,200
and told me to kill you.

218
00:11:44,759 --> 00:11:46,279
But that explains one thing.

219
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:49,600
Zhou Lanxin is afraid
I'll come to see you.

220
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:50,600
So...

221
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:51,679
I came to the right place.

222
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:54,679
Zhou Lanxin...

223
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:56,120
(It seems)

224
00:11:56,559 --> 00:11:58,440
(this is only the beginning.)

225
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:27,560
♪Let the past be buried in the wind♪

226
00:12:29,400 --> 00:12:33,640
♪Perhaps the waning moon knows my pain♪

227
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:38,040
♪It sees the old tenderness
all come to nothing♪

228
00:12:38,640 --> 00:12:41,320
♪How many regrets haunt this world♪

229
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:47,440
♪By the window, whose dreams flicker
by the dying candle♪

230
00:12:49,880 --> 00:12:54,040
♪Things remain, you're gone,
and I'm still dazed♪

231
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:57,400
♪The sandstorm in my eyes♪

232
00:12:58,000 --> 00:13:00,760
♪Turns to a blade's edge♪
(Cheng Residence)

233
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:03,760
♪Cutting through old years♪

234
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:05,480
♪We can never embrace again♪

235
00:13:05,920 --> 00:13:10,560
♪If rain has tears,
wash away the dust of fate♪

236
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:12,560
♪By lamplight, I turn the page♪

237
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:15,480
♪The ink dries, and there you are♪

238
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:17,320
♪Gone to ash in a flash♪

239
00:13:17,920 --> 00:13:19,040
♪Like a blade through my heart♪

240
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:22,560
♪Too late to pull away♪

241
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:24,960
♪The song ends, and all have gone♪

242
00:13:25,400 --> 00:13:29,120
♪Now we must part♪

243
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:32,720
♪Flowers burn the ground,
yet vows are held so lightly♪

244
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:36,120
♪The song ends.
Where shall I seek you in dreams♪

245
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:38,440
♪By the window, a dying candle♪

246
00:13:38,920 --> 00:13:43,360
♪Whose shadow do I yearn for♪
